<task id="task-255" class="- topic/topic task/task "><title class="- topic/title ">Downloading a database billing report</title><shortdesc class="- topic/shortdesc ">Learn how to download a CSV of the billing report grouped by database.</shortdesc><taskbody class="- topic/body task/taskbody "><prereq class="- topic/section task/prereq "><p audience="partner" class="- topic/p ">You must have the <b class="+ topic/ph hi-d/b ">Billing.Admin</b> role to complete this task.</p><p audience="direct-customer" conref="../../../Content_Warehouses/Synergy_MyGeotab/Synergy_security_clearances.dita#topic-9188/p-11560" class="- topic/p "/></prereq><context class="- topic/section task/context "><p class="- topic/p ">You may want to download the database details report to manage costs at the database level. This report is for billing administrators who need to share organized, database-level solution cost data with internal accounting teams for processing.</p><p class="- topic/p ">You can choose to download either a concise table view (only selected columns) or the comprehensive full report (all columns), depending on your current needs.</p></context><steps class="- topic/ol task/steps "><step audience="partner" class="- topic/li task/step "><cmd class="- topic/ph task/cmd ">Navigate to <ph conkeyref="varsNav/BillingMBnav" class="- topic/ph "/> in the main menu.</cmd></step><step audience="direct-customer" class="- topic/li task/step "><cmd class="- topic/ph task/cmd ">Navigate to <ph conkeyref="varsSynNav/storeBillingMonthlyBillsSynNav" class="- topic/ph "/> in the main menu.</cmd></step><step class="- topic/li task/step "><cmd class="- topic/ph task/cmd ">Navigate to the <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Database details</uicontrol> tab.</cmd></step><step class="- topic/li task/step "><cmd class="- topic/ph task/cmd ">Enter the account number, then select a specific billing period (month and year).</cmd></step><step class="- topic/li task/step "><cmd class="- topic/ph task/cmd ">Use the available filters to narrow down the line items within the bill.</cmd></step><step audience="partner" conref="../../../Content_Warehouses/MyAdmin/Reusable_Steps/Shared_steps_MyA.dita#task-6740/step-2328" class="- topic/li task/step "><cmd class="- topic/ph task/cmd "/></step><step audience="direct-customer" conref="../../../Content_Warehouses/MyAdmin/Reusable_Steps/Shared_steps_MyA.dita#task-6740/step-758" class="- topic/li task/step "><cmd class="- topic/ph task/cmd "/></step></steps><result class="- topic/section task/result "><p audience="direct-customer" conref="../../../Content_Warehouses/Synergy_MyGeotab/Synergy_security_clearances.dita#topic-9188/p-14666" class="- topic/p "/><p audience="partner" conref="../../../Content_Warehouses/MyAdmin/Reusable_Steps/Shared_steps_MyA.dita#task-6740/csvReportQueuedResult" class="- topic/p "/></result></taskbody></task>